  "genderedStrings": {
    "$comment": [
      "Arabic requires second-person gender agreement in imperative verbs and",
      "predicate adjectives. Profile.addressGender drives it via addressed(key,",
      "gender) in packages/shared/src/format.ts.",
      "",
      "ONLY these 34 keys carry _f/_m variants. Everything else stays single-form",
      "in the neutral-plural, which is what the existing catalogs already assume.",
